# Root is research-only. New mod folders stay excluded automatically.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/LICENSE.md
!/LICENSE-CODE.txt
!/LICENSE-DOCUMENTATION.txt
!/ship-sizes.txt
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/research/

# Local workflow and reproducible caches.
**/AGENTS.md
**/.agents/
**/.codex/
**/.local/
**/.venv/
**/.packages/
**/.dotnet-home/
**/__pycache__/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/Library/
**/Temp/
**/Logs/
**/UserSettings/
**/player*/
**/build*/
**/kb-method-capture/
**/mod-code/
**/native-code/
**/native-source/
**/HANDOFF.md
**/executor-notes.json

# Compiled/proprietary inputs and generated visual outputs stay local.
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.bytes
*.assets
*.bundle
*.resS
*.log
*.pyc
*.png
*.jpg
*.meta
*.unity
*.mat
**/StreamingAssets/

# Additional local workflow and archive exclusions.
**/PLAN.md
**/BACKLOG.md
**/SESSION*.md
*.zip
*.save
*.nrbf
.env
.env.*
